  "prefLabel": "Nur 403.03 Continuing Education Requirements for MNA",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 403.03 Continuing Education Requirements for MNA. Each applicant for renewal of an MNA license shall complete at least 4 contact hours per year of workshops, conferences, lectures, or in-service educational offerings that are designed to enhance nursing assistant knowledge, judgment, and skills related to medications and/or medication administration.\n\nSource. #7741, eff 8-13-02; ss by #8873, eff 4-24-07; ss by #10299, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10571, eff 4-17-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nur100-800.html"
